{"id":"n-20261024-eoww8f","category":"gaming","display_title":"Avengers Doomsday MLB Promo","display_title_he":"פרומו לאוונג״זרס במיליון","short_summary":"Marvel Studios promoted Avengers: Doomsday with a unique baseball-themed crossover advertisement during Game 1 of the 2026 World Series.","english_level":"C1","words":430,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/avengers-doomsday-promoted-with-baseball-themed-crossover-featuring-mlb-players-during-world-series","title":"Avengers: Doomsday Promoted With Baseball-Themed Crossover Featuring MLB Players During World Series","published_at":"2026-10-24T01:08:16.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:08:16.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-24T05:59:49.753Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Marvel Studios has unveiled a distinctive promotional campaign for its upcoming cinematic blockbuster, Avengers: Doomsday, broadcasting a specialized crossover advertisement during Game 1 of the 2026 World Series on Fox. The live broadcast featured a championship matchup between the Milwaukee Brewers and the Tampa Bay Rays, providing a massive, attentive live audience for the high-profile cinematic preview.","The creative promotional spot is uniquely set on Earth-828 at Ebbets Field, which was the historic former home of the Brooklyn Dodgers prior to its demolition back in 1960 on our actual Earth. Visually, the temporal setting aligns seamlessly with the period of The Fantastic Four: First Steps, complete with historical New York Giants players visible in the background. Within the commercial's narrative, Mr. Fantastic proudly sports a Brooklyn Dodgers cap and takes the pitcher's mound to deliver a dramatically stretchy-armed ceremonial first pitch. Meanwhile, The Thing actively hypes up the players as contemporary Major League Baseball stars including Freddie Freeman, Jacob Misiorowski, Bryce Harper, Randy Arozarena, and Junior Caminero observe closely from the sidelines. The festive proceedings are abruptly and violently interrupted when Dr. Doom launches a sudden attack from the sky, with the advertisement being rapidly interspersed with actual action clips drawn directly from the feature film.","Industry observers and studio executives note that major live sporting events such as the World Series, the Super Bowl, and the NBA Finals continue to serve as primary mediums for Hollywood studios. In an era increasingly dominated by streaming platforms and flexible on-demand entertainment, these high-profile broadcasts remain exceptionally reliable for capturing concentrated, live viewership that actively tunes in together.","Avengers: Doomsday is officially scheduled to hit theaters everywhere on December 18. The upcoming movie features notable casting developments and returns, including the return of Chris Evans as Steve Rogers, which is directly referenced in a film clip utilized in the baseball promo. Additionally, Robert Downey Jr. is shifting from his iconic role as Iron Man to portray Dr. Doom, appearing to abduct heroes in the picture, though fans will also see him as Stark at least one more time starting in 2028 at the upcoming Avengers: Infinity Defense ride located at Disney California Adventure. Despite much of the overall plot remaining tightly shrouded in mystery—with even the participating actors reportedly lacking full awareness of the complete narrative arc—audience enthusiasm appears exceptionally robust. According to available reports, ticket pre-sales for Doomsday are already comfortably outperforming the strong financial numbers posted by the summer blockbuster Spider-Man: Brand New Day. Marvel ultimately recommends that enthusiastic moviegoers do their necessary homework before heading out to the theater to experience Doomsday."],"facts":[{"fact":"Marvel Studios debuted a promo for Avengers: Doomsday during Game 1 of the 2026 World Series on Fox.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The promo is an Avengers-MLB crossover set on Earth-828 at Ebbets Field.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The advertisement features characters like Mr. Fantastic, The Thing, and Dr. Doom, alongside modern MLB players such as Freddie Freeman, Jacob Misiorowski, Bryce Harper, Randy Arozarena, and Junior Caminero.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Avengers: Doomsday is scheduled to arrive in theaters everywhere on December 18.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Live sporting events like the World Series remain prime venues for Hollywood studios to debut trailers because they consistently drive live audiences.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The film features the return of Chris Evans as Steve Rogers and Robert Downey Jr. as Dr. Doom.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Ticket pre-sales for Avengers: Doomsday are currently outpacing those of Spider-Man: Brand New Day.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Marvel Studios","lemma":"Marvel Studios","pos":"noun","he":"מרוול סטודיוס","name":true},{"text":"unveiled","lemma":"unveil","pos":"verb","he":"חשף","name":false},{"text":"distinctive","lemma":"distinctive","pos":"adjective","he":"ייחודי","name":false},{"text":"campaign","lemma":"campaign","pos":"noun","he":"קמפיין","name":false},{"text":"upcoming","lemma":"upcoming","pos":"adjective","he":"הקרוב","name":false},{"text":"cinematic","lemma":"cinematic","pos":"adjective","he":"קולנועי","name":false},{"text":"blockbuster","lemma":"blockbuster","pos":"noun","he":"שובר קופות","name":false},{"text":"Avengers: Doomsday","lemma":"Avengers: Doomsday","pos":"noun","he":"הנוקמים: יום הדין","name":true},{"text":"broadcasting","lemma":"broadcast","pos":"verb","he":"שידור","name":false},{"text":"specialized","lemma":"specialized","pos":"adjective","he":"מתמחה","name":false},{"text":"crossover","lemma":"crossover","pos":"noun","he":"שילוב","name":false},{"text":"advertisement","lemma":"advertisement","pos":"noun","he":"פרסומת","name":false},{"text":"Game 1","lemma":"Game 1","pos